# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values. Never commit .env.
# No credentials are required as of Phase 0. This file is populated as later phases
# introduce services that need them (e.g. a Kaggle API token if a mirrored dataset
# distribution is used in Phase 2, or a Sentinel Hub / Copernicus credential in Phase 11).

# Example (uncomment and fill in only if/when actually used):
# KAGGLE_USERNAME=
# KAGGLE_KEY=
# SENTINELHUB_CLIENT_ID=
# SENTINELHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=
